www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1940-12-31/pdf/FR-1940-12-31.pdf\nSHA-256 of the downloaded file: f5c8d83f2f24cefc067e85d2d41586a346954d6d28e0307cc1e98bc521535e2c\nLocation: 5 FR 5275, PDF pages 1-1 (confidence low)\nMachine-extracted text layer of the official PDF (OCR for 1936-1994 scans). May contain recognition errors and parts of neighbouring documents on the same pages. Not an authenticated transcription: check the PDF pages.\n\n=== PDF page 1 of 34 ===\n^ o n a l^\nFEDERALREGISTER\nVOLUME 5 >$*., «934 c i y \n* ^/VITEO  ^\nNUMBER 252\nW ashington, Tuesday ,  December 31, 1940\nThe President\nEXECUTIVE ORDER\nR evoking  in  P art P roclamation  N o. 1519\nop  A pril  16, 1919, and R eserving  C er ­\ntain  L ands for  A viation  P urposes\nA LA SK A\nBy virtue of the authority vested in \nme by the act of March 12, 1914, c. 37, \n38 Stat. 305, and the act of June 25,1910, \nc. 421, 36 Stat. 847, as amended by the \nact of August 24, 1912, c. 369, 37 Stat. \n497, it is ordered as follows:\n1. Proclamation No. 1519 of April 16, \n1919, withdrawing certain lands in \nAlaska for town-site and other purposes \nin connection with the construction and \noperation of railroad lines, is hereby re­\nvoked as to the following-described areas \nin the NE% sec. 34, T. 13 N., R. 4 W., \nSeward Meridian, Alaska:\nTract No. 1\nBeginning at the point for the quarter- \nsection corner between secs. 27 and 34, \nT. 13 N., R. 4 W., Seward Meridian, \nAlaska, in Hood Lake, thence from said \n","path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/texts/EO_8621.txt","sha256":"9925ddc5b0422b70762cf6491600d39dc4093cd7f483ef7a2ddfed21f9293fb2","source":{"line":126,"path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"c37cd477aaaf09df82af31c45dc2cb06c80678a5e913191c95f368baede2829a"}}]}
